  "title": "Platinum Group Metals: Market Dynamics, Economic Value, and Environmental Impact - AstroForge",
  "summary": "Almost everything you touch daily relies on one thing: platinum group metals (PGMs). From the chips that power your phone to the catalytic converter in your car, PGMs are essential for enabling a clean, modern world. Their unique chemical properties, such as corrosion resistance and stable electrical properties, make them irreplaceable. While we may not always be aware of it, our modern lifestyle would be impossible without these critical elements, PGMs.",
